namespace UObjectToolTips

DreamWidgetBlueprintFactory {
    at    Source/DreamGUIEditor/Private/DataFactory/DreamWidgetBlueprintFactory.cpp#DreamWidgetBlueprintFactory
    src   "Creates a UDreamWidgetBlueprint from the content browser.\n\nTwo pickers, matching UMG's: the parent class (any UDreamUserWidget, so a native or Blueprint base\ncarrying logic and bindings can be derived from) and the root layout container the fresh hierarchy\nstarts with. The root widget itself is always plain -- what varies is the panel on it."
    text  "从内容浏览器创建 UDreamWidgetBlueprint。\n\n两个选择器与 UMG 的相同：父类（可以是任意 UDreamUserWidget，因此可从携带逻辑和绑定的原生或蓝图基类\n派生）以及新层级结构\n起始所用的根布局容器。根控件本身始终是普通控件——变化的是其上的面板。"
    state machine
}

DreamWidgetBlueprintFactory:ParentClass {
    at    Source/DreamGUIEditor/Private/DataFactory/DreamWidgetBlueprintFactory.cpp#DreamWidgetBlueprintFactory:ParentClass
    src   "Parent class of the created Blueprint. Defaults to UDreamUserWidget when the picker is skipped."
    text  "所创建的控件蓝图的父类。跳过选择器时默认为 UDreamUserWidget。"
    state machine
